  "extensions": {
    "story": "## Purpose\n\nMany-to-many member ↔ institute with join path, invite lifecycle, character, and affairs (Shooon) state.\n\n## Scenarios\n\n- **S5** — self-registration channel, mobile invite, admin add.\n- **S4** — per-institute character and affairs state on the dossier.\n\n## Rules\n\n- Unique (`member_id`, `institute_id`).\n- `current_org_employment_*` only meaningful for General Assembly institute (id=1).",
    "scenarioIds": [
      "S4",
      "S5"
